<doc id="78110" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=78110" title="Christina Aguilera">
Christina Aguilera

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Christina duwé papat single kang bisa mapan ana ing nomer siji dhaftar &lt;a href="Billboard%20Hot%20100"&gt;Billboard Hot 100&lt;/a&gt;, kaya ta &lt;a href="Genie%20In%20A%20Bottle"&gt;Genie In A Bottle&lt;/a&gt; (1999), &lt;a href="What%20A%20Girl%20Wants"&gt;What A Girl Wants&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Come%20On%20Over%20Baby%20%28All%20I%20Want%20Is%20You%29"&gt;Come On Over Baby (All I Want Is You)&lt;/a&gt; (2000) uga &lt;a href="Lady%20Marmalade"&gt;Lady Marmalade&lt;/a&gt; (2001). Saliyané 4 single kang ana ing posisi puncak, single saka Christina Aguilera uga ana ing posisi top ten, kaya ta &lt;a href="I%20Turn%20To%20You"&gt;I Turn To You&lt;/a&gt; (2000), &lt;a href="Beautiful"&gt;Beautiful&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ain%27t%20No%20Other%20Man"&gt;Ain't No Other Man&lt;/a&gt; (2006) lan uga &lt;a href="Keeps%20Gettin%27%20Better"&gt;Keeps Gettin' Better&lt;/a&gt; (2008).
Dhebut album pisanané ya iku &lt;a href="Christina%20Aguilera%20%28album%29"&gt;Christina Aguilera&lt;/a&gt; (1999) lan &lt;a href="Back%20to%20Basics"&gt;Back to Basics&lt;/a&gt; (2006) mèlu mapan ing urutan pisanan dhaftar 200 album paling laris vèrsi Billboard Music Chart kanthi angka pangadolan punjul 250.000 iji lan 346.000 iji ana ing pétungan wektu 1 minggu wiwit album mau dirilis menyang pasaran Amérika. Album nomer loro saka Christina, &lt;a href="Stripped"&gt;Stripped&lt;/a&gt; (2002) mapan ana ing posisi nomer loro kanthi angka pangadolan punjul 330.000 iji, déné album natal pisanané ya iku &lt;a href="My%20Kind%20of%20Christmas"&gt;My Kind of Christmas&lt;/a&gt; (2000) mung bisa manggon ana ing posisi nomer 28. &lt;a href="Mi%20Reflejo"&gt;Mi Reflejo&lt;/a&gt; kang diluncuraké nalika taun 2000 uga bisa manggon ana ing posisi puncak pangadolan album paling laris vèrsi Billboard Latin Album.
Sadawané kariré, Christina Agulera wis olèh nominasi Grammy Awards utawané Latin Grammy Awards kaping 18. Christina uga wis kaping papat olèh 4 Grammy Awards kanggo kategori Best New Artist (2000), Best Female Pop Vocal Performance (&lt;a href="Beautiful"&gt;Beautiful&lt;/a&gt; - 2004 lan &lt;a href="Ain%27t%20No%20Other%20Man"&gt;Ain't No Other Man&lt;/a&gt; - 2007) lan Best Pop Collaboration with Vocals bareng karo P!nk, Li'l Kim lan Mya kanggo single &lt;a href="Lady%20Marmalade"&gt;Lady Marmalade&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun 2002. Ana ing &lt;a href="Latin%20Grammy%20Award"&gt;Latin Grammy Award&lt;/a&gt;, Christina uga olèh bebungah kanggo kategori Best Female Pop Vocal Album (2001) kanngo album &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;basa Latin&lt;/a&gt; pisanané ya iku &lt;a href="Mi%20Reflejo"&gt;Mi Reflejo&lt;/a&gt;.
