Steven William

Stefan William Umboh kondhang kanthi jeneng Steven William utawa Stefan William (#ALIH). Stefan William iku juru main filem kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Stefan William duwé katurunan saka Indonésia ya iku ibuné lan bapaké saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Stefan William iku anak lanang kang sepisanan saka &lt;a href="Clinton%20Avery"&gt;Clinton Avery&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Ellen%20Thelma%20Umboh"&gt;Ellen Thelma Umboh&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Manado"&gt;Manado&lt;/a&gt;). Stefan William duwé adhik wadon kang jenenge Jennifer Avery. Jennifer Avery saiki manggon ing nagara (&lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;) bareng karo bapak lan ibuné. Stefan William iku juru main sinétron kang akting dadi tokoh &lt;a href="Yudha"&gt;Yudha&lt;/a&gt; ing sinétron kang judhulé &lt;a href="Arti%20Sahabat"&gt;Arti Sahabat&lt;/a&gt;. Sinetron iki disiyaraké ing salah sijiné stasiun &lt;a href="tivi"&gt;tivi&lt;/a&gt; swasta kang jenengé &lt;a href="Indosiar"&gt;Indosiar&lt;/a&gt;. Ing sinétron iki Stefan William main karo &lt;a href="Yuki%20Kato"&gt;Yuki Kato&lt;/a&gt; kang main dadi tokoh &lt;a href="Ajeng"&gt;Ajeng&lt;/a&gt;. Raine kang mirib karo &lt;a href="Justin%20Bieber"&gt;Justin Bieber&lt;/a&gt; ndadeaké Stefan William dadi rikat misuwur lan dadi idola para rumaja. Stefan William biyasa diundang kanthi jeneng Stefan William. Stefan William ngugemi &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kristen%20Protestan"&gt;Kristen Protestan&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku bintang &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; iki duwé hobi &lt;a href="ulah%20raga"&gt;ulah raga&lt;/a&gt;.
