<h2>Sala Batik Fashion 2010</h2>
Sala Batik Fashion 2010.
Sala Batik Fashion kaping pindho dianakake tanggal &lt;a href="22"&gt;22&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="24%20Juni"&gt;24 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt; ing koridor Ngarsopuro. Sawisé pambuka déning wali kutha, diterusake karo acara fashion show déning Himpunan Ratna Busana, banjur parade saka saben-saben désainer. Désainer kang mèlu ing acara iki kaya ta Tuty kebaya, Joko SSP, Rory Wardana, Irine Bridal, Alan, Joko Widiarto, Irawati Kusumoasri, Djongko Raharjo, Retno Tan, Eko MIM. &lt;a href="Batik%20Danar%20Hadi"&gt;Batik Danar Hadi&lt;/a&gt; uga ngetokaké koleksine kang paling anyar ya iku "Jawa Dwipa", déné bathik Semar mamerake 8 rancangan karya désainer &lt;a href="Charles%20Sutanto"&gt;Charles Sutanto&lt;/a&gt;.
