Tata Young (#ALIH jeneng lairé Amita Marie Young (Thai: อมิตา มารี ยัง)) dhèwèké iku &lt;a href="penyanyi"&gt;penyanyi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="penari"&gt;penari&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka Thailand, Bapaké saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tim%20Young"&gt;Tim Young&lt;/a&gt; lan ibuné iku saka &lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;.
dhèwèké miwiti kariré nalika umur 11 taun, kondhang amarga tetembangan kang irah-irahan One Night Only dhèwèké menangaké kontès Thailand Junior Singing Contest.
Debut albumé kang kaping pisan dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;, AMITA TATA YOUNG, lan basané Thailand.
Namung limang wsasi albumé mau bisa kaedol nganti seyuta kopi.
Kasuksesané iki dimeluni karo panghargan kang diraihé, ya iku panghargan Favorite Singer, Best Album lan Best Music Video ning Vote Awards &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;.
Rong taun sawisé ngerilis album kang kaping pisan, taun &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;, Tata ngerilis albumé kang kaping loro, AMAZING TATA.
Ning taun iki dhèwèké olih panghargan Golden Pikkanes God Award.
Sukses ning donya nyanyi, Tata wiwit nyoba donya akting.
Debuté ning layar lebar &lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; THE RED BIKE STORY (&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;) lan diterusaké karo &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; O-NEGATIVE lan PLAI TEIN.
Albumé kang kaping teluné dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, TATA YOUNG.
Single A-bo-da-be, Tua Saeb, Wan Jai lan Keb Chan Wai Yuen Khang Thoe Tham Mai kang ana ning album iki langsung dadi top hits ning radio.
Rong taun sawisé iku, Tata ngerilis albumé kang kaping papat, REAL TT (2003).
Ning album mau dhèwèké njagokaké single Yak Keb Thoe Wai Thang Song Khon lan Super Fan, Tata wiwit wani dadi co-producer.
Sukses ning Thailand, Tata wiwit nyoba kanggo go international.
Debut internasional dirilis ning taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, I BELIEVE.
Hit single ning album iki, ya iku Sexy, Naughhty, Bitchy, bisa ngejuarai tangga lagu ning nagara-nagara &lt;a href="Asia"&gt;Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;.
Single sawisé iku uga dadi top request, I Believe lan Cinderella.
Esih ning taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, Tata olih kasempatan kanggo ngisi soundtrack ning filem Bollywood, DHOOM.
Single kang dijuduli Dhoom Dhoom,langsung kondhang ning &lt;a href="Billboards"&gt;Billboards&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, Tata ngerilis album kang dijuduli DANGEROUS TATA.
Ning taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké ngerilis album kompilasi BEST OF TATA YOUNG.
&lt;a href="Agustus"&gt;Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, Tata ngerilis album internasional kang kaping loroné, TEMPERATURE RISING.
Single kang diandelaké ning album iki, El Nin-Yo uga sukses.
