Acara &lt;a href="M%21%20Countdown"&gt;M! Countdown&lt;/a&gt; ing M.Net &lt;a href="18%20Juli"&gt;18 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; dadi papan manggung Girl's Generation kang pisanan. SNSD nembangke tembang "다시 만난 세계 (&lt;a href="Into%20the%20New%20World%20%28lagu%29"&gt;Into the New World&lt;/a&gt;)" kang dirilis minangka singel pisanane Girl's Generation, Agustus 2007. Singel uga ana 2 tembang liyané ya iku, "Beginning" lan "Perfect For You (소원)", sarta versi instrumental "?다시 만난 세계 (Into the New World)". Irah-irahane tembang "Perfect For You" ganti dadi "Honey" ing album perdanane, &lt;a href="Girls%27%20Generation%20%28album%20taun%202007%29"&gt;Girls' Generation&lt;/a&gt;. Singel "&lt;a href="Into%20the%20New%20World%20%28lagu%29"&gt;Into the New World&lt;/a&gt;" bareng karo kagiyatan promosi. SNSD tampil ing acara Popular Songs ing &lt;a href="SBS"&gt;SBS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Show%21%20Music%20Core"&gt;Show! Music Core&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Munhwa%20Broadcasting%20Corporation"&gt;MBC&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Music%20Bank"&gt;Music Bank&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Korean%20Broadcasting%20System"&gt;KBS&lt;/a&gt;.
Album perdana &lt;a href="Girls%27%20Generation%20%28album%20taun%202007%29"&gt;소녀시대 (Girls' Generation)&lt;/a&gt; dirilis pungkasane mangsa palastra 2007 kanthi tembang andalan kang padha irah-irahane. Nalika ditembangake déning &lt;a href="Lee%20Seung%20Chul"&gt;Lee Seung Chul&lt;/a&gt;, tembang "&lt;a href="Girls%27%20Generation%20%28lagu%29"&gt;Girls' Generation&lt;/a&gt;" sukses minangka tembang hits, nanging nalika ditembangake dhéwé, album iki mung payu 121.143 kopi.
