<li>Takbiratul Ihram kaloro banjur maca &lt;a href="shalawat"&gt;shalawat&lt;/a&gt; marang &lt;a href="Rasulullah%20SAW"&gt;Rasulullah SAW&lt;/a&gt; minimal:"Allahumma Shalli 'alaa Muhammadin" tegesé: "Yaa Allah paringana salawat marang Muhammad"</<li>
