<doc id="78611" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=78611" title="Umar Patek">
Umar Patek

Umar Patek (lair 1970) is a member of &lt;a href="Jemaah%20Islamiyah"&gt;Jemaah Islamiyah&lt;/a&gt; sing dadi buron ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; kanthi tuntutan térorisme. Ditawakaké bebungah sing gedhéné $1 yuta déning Program Bebungah kanggo kaadilan &lt;a href="Rewards%20For%20Justice%20Program"&gt;Rewards For Justice Program&lt;/a&gt; tumrap informasi sing bisa njalari Umar Patek bisa dicekel.
Patek didakwa gawé bahan peledhak sing dianggo ngebom &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;, sing niwasaké 202 jiwa.
Patek &lt;a href="lair"&gt;lair&lt;/a&gt; taun 1970 lan minangka wong Jawa katurunan Arab, dhuwuré 166&amp;nbsp;cm, bobot 60&amp;nbsp;kg. Umar Patek uga dikenal kanthi jeneng Umar Kecil, Umar (Arab), Pa'tek, Pak Taek, Abu Syekh, lan Zacky.#ALIH 
Patek ditangkep déning aparat kaamanan &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Abbotabad"&gt;Abbotabad&lt;/a&gt; ing 25 Januari 2011 kanthi bebungah 1 yuta &lt;a href="dolar"&gt;dolar&lt;/a&gt;. 
Tanggal 11 Agustus 2011, Umar Patek dièkstradisi ke Indonesia.
