<doc id="78623" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=78623" title="Anatolia">
Anatolia

Anatolia (&lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: ανατολή Anatolē utawa Asia cilik, "mlethèké srengéngé" utawa "wétan"; pabandhingan "Asia Wétan" lan "Levant", ana ing étimologi umum &lt;a href="basa%20Turki"&gt;basa Turki&lt;/a&gt; Anadolu saka "ibu" lan dolu "isi"), uga duwé jeneng ing &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt; Asia Minor, yaiku kawasan ing &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-kulon"&gt;Asia Kidul-kulon&lt;/a&gt; kang saiki bisa dipadhaké karo &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt; pérangan Asia.
Amarga panggoné kang strategis ana ing ketemuné &lt;a href="Asia"&gt;Asia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt;, Anatolia dadi panggonan lairé paradhaban wiwit nalika isih jaman prasajarah, kaya &lt;a href="n%C3%A9olitik"&gt;néolitik&lt;/a&gt; yaiku néolitik &lt;a href="Catalh%C3%B6y%C3%BCk"&gt;Catalhöyük&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cay%C3%B6n%C3%BC"&gt;Cayönü&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nevali%20Cori"&gt;Nevali Cori&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hacilar"&gt;Hacilar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="G%C3%B6bekli%20Tepe"&gt;Göbekli Tepe&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mersin"&gt;Mersin&lt;/a&gt;. Pamukiman Troya kang diwiwiti ana ing jaman Néolitiknamun nganti tekan abad wesi.
Paradhaban lan pendhudhuk utama kang manggon utawa nelukaké Anatolia kalebu uga &lt;a href="Hattia"&gt;Hattia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Luwia"&gt;Luwia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hittit"&gt;Hittit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Phrygia"&gt;Phrygia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Simeria"&gt;Simeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lidia"&gt;Lidia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Pèrsi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kelt"&gt;Kelt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tabal"&gt;Tabal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mesekh"&gt;Mesekh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pelasgia"&gt;Pelasgia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Armenia"&gt;Armenia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Romawi"&gt;Romawi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Goth"&gt;Goth&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kurd"&gt;Kurd&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bizantium"&gt;Bizantium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Turki%20Seljuk"&gt;Turki Seljuk&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Turki%20Utsmani"&gt;Turki Utsmani&lt;/a&gt;. Kabèh suku mau kalebu ana ing budaya ètnis lan linguistik.
Sadawané sajarah kang ana, pendhudhuk Anatolia wis migunakaké basa Indo-Éropa lan &lt;a href="Semit"&gt;Semit&lt;/a&gt;. Kasunyatan kang ana yaiku basa nalika jaman purbakala Hittit Indo-Éropa lan Luwia. Sapérangan sarjana uga wis ngusulaké Anatolia dadi panggonan kanggo pusat hipotesis saka &lt;a href="basa%20Indo-%C3%89ropa"&gt;basa Indo-Éropa&lt;/a&gt;. Panulis liyané uga wis ngusulaké asal pendhudhuk Anatolia yaiku &lt;a href="bangsa%20Etruria"&gt;bangsa Etruria&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt; kuna. Saiki akèh saka pendhudhuk Anatolia kang minangka panutur asli basa Turki, kang wis ditepungaké déning paneluk Anatolia déning wong-wong saka &lt;a href="Karajan%20Ottoman"&gt;Karajan Ottoman&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="abad%20ka-13"&gt;abad ka-13&lt;/a&gt;.
