Tteokguk

Tteokguk (떡국) ya iku jinis sop kang digawé saka &lt;a href="adonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="beras"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt; kang digodhog ing &lt;a href="kaldu"&gt;kaldu&lt;/a&gt;. Masakan tteokguk ateges sup roti beras, lumrahé disuguhake ing dina &lt;a href="Seollal"&gt;Seollal&lt;/a&gt; utawa taun anyar &lt;a href="Imlek"&gt;Imlek&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;Koréa&lt;/a&gt;. Kaldun diwènèhi bahan-bahan kaya ta &lt;a href="bawang%20perai"&gt;bawang perai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="panggang"&gt;panggang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; goreng, lan roti beras. Yèn wis mateng, roti beras baka ngembang ing godhohan sup lan siyap disuguhake. Saliyané dipangan nalika dina &lt;a href="Seollal"&gt;Seollal&lt;/a&gt;, tteokguk uga dipangan ing dina riyaya wulan purnama kang wiwitan (&lt;a href="Jeongwol%20Daeboreum"&gt;Jeongwol Daeboreum&lt;/a&gt;). Saiki tteokguk dipangan bebarengan karo &lt;a href="mandu"&gt;mandu&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="pangsit"&gt;pangsit&lt;/a&gt;) kang isiné &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; kang diwènèhi &lt;a href="bumbu"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="janganan"&gt;janganan&lt;/a&gt;, mula &lt;a href="sop"&gt;sop&lt;/a&gt; iki uga diarani&lt;a href="mandutguk"&gt;mandutguk&lt;/a&gt; (sop &lt;a href="mandu"&gt;mandu&lt;/a&gt;).
