KARIR.
Shu Qi miwiti kariré dadi cover Penthouse &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt; kanggo edisi &lt;a href="F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;.
Awit iku, dhèwèké nyambut gawé karo manajemen &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt; kang dipimpinan déning &lt;a href="Manfred%20Wing"&gt;Manfred Wing&lt;/a&gt;
