<h2>Sajarah Dipunbentuk Native Deen</h2>
Sajarah Dipunbentuk Native Deen.
Native Deen miwiti karir saking nembang piyambak ing salah satunggalipun pagelaran inggih punika ‘’&lt;a href="Camping%20Muslim%20Youth%20of%20North%20America%20%28MYNA%29"&gt;Camping Muslim Youth of North America (MYNA)&lt;/a&gt;’’. Sesampunipun punika katiga personel Native Deen sareng- sareng damel grup Native Deen ugi kanggé syiar agami &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Native Deen miwiti saking rekaman ing taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;, sesampunipun punika Native Deen pindah saking &lt;a href="Midwest"&gt;Midwest&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Washington%20DC"&gt;Washington DC&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; Native Deen nembé damel album kang no satunggal. 2 taun sesampunipun punika damel album kaping kalih. Native Deen saged terkenal amargi acara radio ingkang gadhah tema &lt;a href="On%20The%20Scene%20with%20%E2%80%98%E2%80%99Native%20Deen"&gt;On The Scene with ‘’Native Deen&lt;/a&gt;’’ kang dipunsiaraken ing &lt;a href="Islamic%20Brodcasting%20Network%20%28IBM%29%20website"&gt;Islamic Brodcasting Network (IBM) website&lt;/a&gt;.
Native Deen sampun tour ing nagara- nagara inggih punika &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dubai"&gt;Dubai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt;, ngantos &lt;a href="Palestina"&gt;Palestina&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambaipun sampun gadhah &lt;a href="Mahabba%20Award"&gt;Mahabba Award&lt;/a&gt; 2006.
Sapanunggalipun punika Native Deen kolaborasi kaliyan &lt;a href="Tabib%20Qiu"&gt;Tabib Qiu&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Soul%20Id"&gt;Soul Id&lt;/a&gt; ingkang nembé konser ing &lt;a href="America%20Pasific%20Place"&gt;America Pasific Place&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;. Native Deen gadhah impian kanggé saged nembang nganggé basa &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;.
